7,Kosraean Facts For Kids | AstroSafe Search,https://www.astrosafe.co/article/kosraean,"The culture of Kosraeans is vibrant, filled with celebrations, music, and delicious food! 🍲 Traditional dance and songs are important parts of their celebrations. Each year, they celebrate special events like the Kosrae Festival, where everyone shares their culture through dance and feasting!",Kosraean,Austronesian
